Brain - Dragon (any, adult)	KEY:Brain - Dragon (any adult)	TYPE:Goods.PowerComponent	COST:2000	WT:0	SOURCEPAGE:p.1263	DESC:This Brain is a Power Component that can be used to pay 400 XP worth of XP for crafting a Intelligent magic items. The brain of an adult dragon can be used to offset the XP cost of the base price modifier and any powers shared by the dragon whose brain was used. Note that the item cannot possess any mental ability scores higher than that of the dragon whose brain was used and the alignment of the item always matches that of the dragon.&nl;Note: See the Power Components chapter for more information on power components. [Dragon #332 (Cutting Up The Dragon – Useful Bits From Formidable Foes)]
